      "text": "DispositionController\nexecuteDisposition\n完整源/目标控制快照 + 案件批准\n扣 lot / 搬预留 / 转账同事务\n不能绕过 SECURITY_PAUSED",
      "originalText": "DispositionController\nexecuteDisposition\n完整源/目标控制快照 + 案件批准\n扣 lot / 搬预留 / 转账同事务\n不能绕过 SECURITY_PAUSED",
